   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Need manager E3202 and owner E1006; check their status.\n\nDelegate expired yesterday, so Carmen's manager Simone Adler (E3205) approves; check her status.\n\nHi Noah, you now have access to hr-analytics.\n\nIt's a sensitive group, so it needed two approvals, and both are recorded:\n- **Simone Adler** approved as your manager's stand-in. Carmen is on leave, and her delegate's cover ended on 10/27.\n- **Elena Rossi** approved as the group owner.\n\nI've updated ticket T-6012. Let me know if the headcount dashboard still won't open."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that's great. I'll give the headcount dashboard a try now. Just so I know for next time, who should I go to if I need access like this again while Carmen's out?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "For now, that's Simone Adler. She's Carmen's manager, so she approves in Carmen's place while Carmen is on leave and has no valid delegate. Carmen's leave runs until 2026-11-15.\n\nCarmen's previous delegate, Peter Lindqvist, only covered 10/1 to 10/27, so he can't approve now. If Carmen sets a new delegate, that person could approve instead.\n\nYou can ask me directly, as you did today. I'll work out the current approvers and request the approvals. Sensitive groups like this one also need the group owner's approval. For hr-analytics that's Elena Rossi."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Got it, thanks. So next time I'd check with you and you'll sort out Simone and Elena. I'll try the dashboard now and let you know if it still won't open."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that's right. Next time, send me the request and I'll work out who needs to approve and ask them. The approvers can change, for example if Carmen is back or sets a new delegate. Which group it is also affects who I ask, so I'll check each time.\n\nMessage me if the dashboard still won't open."
  }
